    "body": "## Proposed Behavior\n\nAdd an `escapeKey` option to configure Escape key behavior:\n\n- `'none'` — no action, preserves current behavior\n- `'clear'` — clears the input field, allowing the user to start a new search\n- `'cancel'` — resolves the prompt with `undefined`, cancelling gracefully\n- `'clear-then-cancel'` (default) — if input has text, clear it first; \n   if input is already empty, cancel the prompt\n\n## Example\n\n```js\nconst answer = await search({\n  message: 'Select an item',\n  source: (input) => filter(input),\n  escapeKey: 'clear-then-cancel',\n});\n\nif (answer === undefined) {\n  // user cancelled\n}\n```",
